T36	Quotation 12004 12011	"Well,"
T37	Cue 12012 12016	said
T38	Entity 12017 12021	Emma
T39	Quotation 12048 12360	"you want to hear about the wedding; and I shall be happy to tell you, for we all behaved charmingly.  Every body was punctual, every body in their best looks: not a tear, and hardly a long face to be seen.  Oh no; we all felt that we were going to be only half a mile apart, and were sure of meeting every day."
R57	Cueing Arg1:T37 Arg2:T36	
R58	Cueing Arg1:T37 Arg2:T39	
